# __NAME__

An Idrak plug-in, written with Idrak's public API only. It brings:

- softplus as a differentiable function (`src/__NAME__/Plugin.cs`), applied in a network builder's lambda.

```
dotnet build
dotnet run --project tests/__NAME__.Tests            # the tests on the CPU; add -- vulkan:0 for another device
```

From your own code, reference the project (or its package) and use `__NAMESPACE__.Plugin.Softplus`. Registering a
plug-in's parts by name is not on the new design yet.
